    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=684 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could some legends be real? Imagine if technology priests once lived in the pyramids of Ancient Egypt. What if today's technology was actually created back then?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two of the forgotten gods of Ancient Egypt have awakened. But to unleash their powers, they need a third body. Will <i>you</i> be the third?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Third</strong>, you play as an archaeologist trapped in a mysterious temple where ancient powers are beginning to rise. With realistic graphics and a chilling atmosphere, this immersive horror experience will pull you deep into a world filled with forgotten rituals and eternal darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a terrifying journey that blurs the line between myth and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient secrets, follow the clues left by those who came before you, and uncover horrifying truths. Explore cursed corridors, solve puzzles, and do whatever it takes to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0cfcdb3bb1684cd35637d411c9a6dddf.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0cfcdb3bb1684cd35637d411c9a6dddf.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0cfcdb3bb1684cd35637d411c9a6dddf.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/3db7e332fc4ae9409c57c3f36cf0b950.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/3db7e332fc4ae9409c57c3f36cf0b950.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/3db7e332fc4ae9409c57c3f36cf0b950.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a1ac558af916a0522db4e987eb1c9a36.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a1ac558af916a0522db4e987eb1c9a36.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a1ac558af916a0522db4e987eb1c9a36.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a305b142ecb745e6e08bbab5f8e04ce4.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a305b142ecb745e6e08bbab5f8e04ce4.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a305b142ecb745e6e08bbab5f8e04ce4.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=684 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/59c5a4b6b2b65839d1c567c422f200a7.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could some legends be real? Imagine if technology priests once lived in the pyramids of Ancient Egypt. What if today's technology was actually created back then?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two of the forgotten gods of Ancient Egypt have awakened. But to unleash their powers, they need a third body. Will <i>you</i> be the third?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Third</strong>, you play as an archaeologist trapped in a mysterious temple where ancient powers are beginning to rise. With realistic graphics and a chilling atmosphere, this immersive horror experience will pull you deep into a world filled with forgotten rituals and eternal darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a terrifying journey that blurs the line between myth and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient secrets, follow the clues left by those who came before you, and uncover horrifying truths. Explore cursed corridors, solve puzzles, and do whatever it takes to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0cfcdb3bb1684cd35637d411c9a6dddf.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0cfcdb3bb1684cd35637d411c9a6dddf.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0cfcdb3bb1684cd35637d411c9a6dddf.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/3db7e332fc4ae9409c57c3f36cf0b950.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/3db7e332fc4ae9409c57c3f36cf0b950.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/3db7e332fc4ae9409c57c3f36cf0b950.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a1ac558af916a0522db4e987eb1c9a36.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a1ac558af916a0522db4e987eb1c9a36.webm?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a1ac558af916a0522db4e987eb1c9a36.mp4?t=1755598832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/a305b142ecb745e6e08bbab5f8e04ce4.poster.avif?t=1755598832\" width=512 height=320 ><source 